                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "6c55df9b-4b0d-43a6-af7e-f20bcee4e19c",
                        "entry_id": "e80c8116-65c0-3bd3-a27e-7c1d514702b2",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "памфле́тах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be6d9299-ae41-3821-86b1-3bb8ce9f78fd",
                        "entry_id": "e80c8116-65c0-3bd3-a27e-7c1d514702b2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "художественно-публицистическое произведение остросатирического характера, создаваемое с целью социально-политического обличения кого-либо, чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1fbf95b-17c5-4cf8-a256-a251782fe9f2",
                                "sense_id": "be6d9299-ae41-3821-86b1-3bb8ce9f78fd",
                                "text": "Лев Каменев вынес рукописи окончательный вердикт: «Это острый памфлет на современность, печатать ни в коем случае нельзя»."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d68b5217-f10e-45c8-9ac2-f646e5d35da3",
                                "sense_id": "be6d9299-ae41-3821-86b1-3bb8ce9f78fd",
                                "text": "Государь, уезжая, оставил в Москве проект новой организации .. Вот тебе случай писать политический памфлет, и даже его напечатать .."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a22c1e79-8787-44fc-bde6-9808c9ba0333",
                        "source_entry_id": "e80c8116-65c0-3bd3-a27e-7c1d514702b2",
                        "source_sense_id": "be6d9299-ae41-3821-86b1-3bb8ce9f78fd",
                        "target_lang_word": "lampoon",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lampoon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b90dfe00-c1e9-3dd3-a83b-e638164af95d",
                                        "entry_id": "d1577b58-642b-3d2b-9714-415d9964c636",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A written attack or other work ridiculing a person, group, or institution; especially, a satirical one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "774698c1-e91a-4ae7-aea5-88459a278368",
                                                "sense_id": "b90dfe00-c1e9-3dd3-a83b-e638164af95d",
                                                "text": "To say truth, Ma'am, 'tis very vulgar to Print and as my little Productions are mostly Satires and Lampoons I find they circulate more by giving copies in confidence to the Friends of the Parties—"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b90c6354-8e97-4eb0-8ac9-ca0eda51cd89",
                                                "sense_id": "b90dfe00-c1e9-3dd3-a83b-e638164af95d",
                                                "text": "\"Dangerous things, sir—dangerous things!\" exclaimed Mr. Lintot, drawing a deep breath of air from the open window: \"do you know, sir, Curl published a lampoon on Lord Hervey the other day, who said that he would have horsewhipped him if he could have found his way into the city..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "lampoon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24e673c4-fe1d-3a57-8c56-29b7eeb22a4b",
                                        "entry_id": "637155ea-a6c9-3c38-ac1a-49ced8536760",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To satirize or poke fun at."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cde36e58-7ecd-4906-880e-0b56eadefdf2",
                                                "sense_id": "24e673c4-fe1d-3a57-8c56-29b7eeb22a4b",
                                                "text": "Her tone shift involved former Presidents Barack Obama and Bill Clinton lampooning their fellow ex-president as a figure of ridicule. Then Harris closed the trap with a line in her convention speech: “Trump is an unserious man. But the consequences … of putting Donald Trump back in the White House are extremely serious.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f9e1de9d-9b29-43d8-a315-cad5ca52ce5a",
                        "source_entry_id": "e80c8116-65c0-3bd3-a27e-7c1d514702b2",
                        "source_sense_id": "be6d9299-ae41-3821-86b1-3bb8ce9f78fd",
                        "target_lang_word": "panfleto",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "panfleto",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e2850b8-45fc-3fc2-b478-8d5db6e9a582",
                                        "entry_id": "34e5daf7-1a4a-3f52-85e3-4ac2ee9498c7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Folleto o libreto, habitualmente de tipo propagandístico y de contenido sesgado a favor de una opinión o causa determinada."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "18ce327f-eff0-40a4-a2c0-4b7e9beed104",
                        "source_entry_id": "e80c8116-65c0-3bd3-a27e-7c1d514702b2",
                        "source_sense_id": "be6d9299-ae41-3821-86b1-3bb8ce9f78fd",
                        "target_lang_word": "libelo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "libelo",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fa2702e-963e-37a1-bbc2-4012e402c98c",
                                        "entry_id": "65d1f5d1-cdfd-3124-9c24-33fdb44f0b62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Libro breve."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "outdated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a95334b2-2d63-4a0f-b341-cf7f969f0674",
                                                "sense_id": "3fa2702e-963e-37a1-bbc2-4012e402c98c",
                                                "text": "Cornelio Tácito, en el libelo que compuso de los alemanes, afirma también que los alemanes al mismo Mercurio, en ciertos días, hombres sacrificaban."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b5defe3-d7cb-3214-92de-396464598861",
                                        "entry_id": "65d1f5d1-cdfd-3124-9c24-33fdb44f0b62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Escrito que injuria la reputación de alguno."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e99062bd-08de-4177-8d38-9e98d2a3d738",
                                                "sense_id": "8b5defe3-d7cb-3214-92de-396464598861",
                                                "text": "Y antes que Su Alteza viniese á ella se hizo un pasquín ó libelo infamatorio diciendo mal de cuantos había en la villa como contra los que habían entrado de la Corte."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
